  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2015-01-09",
   "text": "American Job Protection Act \n Amends the Internal Revenue Code to repeal provisions added by the Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act requiring certain employers who have a workforce of 50 or more full-time employees to provide health insurance coverage for their employees."
